   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">D9D6YJ The YikeBike goes international YikeBike, the compact electric bike named by Time Magazine as one of the top inventions of 2009, has won the Supreme Award for Product Design and Gold Award for Consumer Product at the 2010Â Best Design Awards. YikeBike also won first place in theÂ International Design AwardsÂ Â“Urban Sustainable DesignÂ” category and has been included in the Guinness Book of World records as the most compact electric bike in the world. It has also won a 2011 iF product design award.  YikeBikes can be bought exclusively at theÂ YikeBike online shop. They are for sale in Europe, US,</rdf:li>
